@startuml domain-model-class
' ============================================================
' L1 - 领域模型类图（Domain Model Class）
' 事实来源（代码锚点）：backend/lib/cgc_2046 资源注册清单
'   （global_api.ex / api.ex / mcp.ex / payments.ex:22,24）及各资源模块
'   （漂移复核：DRIFT-EVIDENCE/L1-domain-model.md §2）
' 按 context 分层：全局 / 身份租户 / 引擎 / MCP / 业务 / 支付 / 学习教研；
' 突出业务 workflow 核心聚合（Enrollment、Sponsorship、
' SpeakerInvitation、Order）与引擎（Definition/Run/Step）；
' 教研产出 = ResearchOutput 活文档（#180）+ WorkflowRun.facts 镜像。
' ============================================================
title CGC 平台领域模型类图（L1）
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

package "全局 context" #E8F0FE {
    class User {
        + id: uuid
        + email: string
        + is_platform_admin: boolean
    }
    class Workspace {
        + id: uuid
        + slug: string (唯一)
        + join_policy: open|request|invite_only
        + sponsorship_enabled: boolean
        + sponsorship_tiers: json（内嵌档位）
}

package "身份/租户 context" #F3E8FD {
    class WorkspaceMembership
    class MembershipRole
    class Role {
        + name: string
    }
    class Profile
    class Invitation
    class JoinRequest
}

package "引擎 context" #FDE8F0 {
    class WorkflowDefinition {
        + type: learning|research|speaker_invitation
                |enrollment|sponsorship（预留）
        + version: integer
        + input_schema: json
        + node_def: Runic.Workflow
        + status: draft|published|archived
    }
    class WorkflowRun {
        + status: pending|running|waiting|expired
                  |succeeded|failed|cancelled
        + input_snapshot: json
        + facts: json
        + partition_id: uuid  (= workspace_id)
    }
    class Step {
        + type: auto|manual|gate|sub_workflow
        + sub_definition_id
    }
    class StepRole
    class SignalLog
}

package "MCP context" #FEF9C3 {
    class PendingOperation {
        + status: pending|confirmed|cancelled
    }
    class ToolCallLog {
        + result_status: ok|error|needs_confirmation|forbidden
    }
}

package "业务 context" #F0FDE8 {
    class Event {
        + enrollment_policy / capacity
        + registration_deadline / status
        + sponsorship_enabled / sponsorship_deadline
        + sponsorship_tiers: json（内嵌档位）
        + pricing_enabled / price_tiers: json（内嵌档位）
    }
    class Course {
        + enrollment_policy / capacity
        + registration_deadline / status
        + pricing_enabled / price_tiers: json（内嵌档位）
    }
    class Enrollment {
        + status: pending|payment_pending|confirmed
                  |rejected|expired|cancelled
        + invite_batch_id
        + approved_by / approved_at / rejection_reason
    }
    class InviteBatch {
        + invite_code (唯一)
        + quota / remaining_quota (原子扣减)
        + expires_at / status
    }
    class Sponsorship {
        + level: event|workspace
        + tier_id（内嵌档位 id）/ tier_name
        + status: pending|active|rejected|ended|expired
        + approved_by / approved_at
    }
    class SpeakerInvitation {
        + token_hash (一次性)
        + status: invited|accepted|declined|completed
        + speaker_user_id (接受后绑定)
    }
}

package "支付 context" #FFE9EC {
    class Order {
        + provider: wechat_jsapi|wechat_native
                  |alipay_page|alipay_wap
        + status: pending|paid|refunding|refunded
                  |refund_failed|cancelled|expired
        + out_trade_no (唯一) / transaction_id
        + amount_cents / tier_snapshot: json（下单档位快照）
        + expire_at（座位保留限时窗，默认 2h）
    }
    class WebhookEvent {
        + provider: wechat|alipay
        + event_id / payload: json
        + status: received|processed
        UK (provider, event_id) 渠道幂等去重
    }
}

package "学习/教研闭环 context" #ECFDF5 {
    class ResearchOutput {
        + key: string（course_<id>）/ kind: issues
        + data: json（course content 活文档）
        + submitted_by / workflow_run_id（审计）
        UK (key, kind) 全局唯一
    }
    class LearningRecord {
        + issue_id / item_id: string（宽存，无内容外键）
        + done: boolean（三态投影唯一事实源）
        + evidence / recorded_at
        + enrollment_id / run_id（审计列）
        UK (course_id, user_id, issue_id, item_id)
    }
}

' ---------- 关系 ----------
User "1" -- "0..*" WorkspaceMembership : 加入
Workspace "1" -- "0..*" WorkspaceMembership : 包含
WorkspaceMembership "1" -- "0..*" MembershipRole : 拥有
Role "1" -- "0..*" MembershipRole : 被授予
WorkspaceMembership "1" -- "0..1" Profile : 公开资料

Workspace "1" -- "0..*" WorkflowDefinition : 承载流程
WorkflowDefinition "1" -- "0..*" Step : 分解节点
WorkflowDefinition "1" -- "0..*" WorkflowRun : 实例化
WorkflowRun "1" -- "0..*" SignalLog : 信号日志
Step "1" -- "0..*" StepRole : 执行角色

Workspace "1" -- "0..*" Event : 举办活动
Workspace "1" -- "0..*" Course : 开设课程
Event "1" -- "0..*" Enrollment : 报名
Course "1" -- "0..*" Enrollment : 报名
Event "1" -- "0..*" InviteBatch : 邀请批次
InviteBatch "1" -- "0..*" Enrollment : 批次扣减
Event "1" -- "0..*" Sponsorship : Event 级赞助
Event "1" -- "0..*" SpeakerInvitation : 邀请演讲者

WorkflowRun "1" -- "0..*" Enrollment : 创建报名
WorkflowRun "1" -- "0..*" Sponsorship : 创建赞助
WorkflowRun "1" -- "0..*" SpeakerInvitation : 创建邀请

Enrollment "1" -- "0..*" Order : 缴费订单
Course "1" -- "0..*" LearningRecord : 学习记忆
User "1" -- "0..*" LearningRecord : 持有记忆（user_id 无 Ash 关系）
WorkflowRun "1" -- "0..*" ResearchOutput : 教研产出（审计列镜像）

note bottom of Order
  R11：同一 Enrollment 至多一笔非终态订单
  （enrollment_id 部分唯一 WHERE status IN
  pending/paid/refunding/refund_failed）；
  退款 = 取消报名（ADR-0007）。
end note

note bottom of WebhookEvent
  内部资源：无租户列、无外键、永不暴露
  GraphQL/Admin；(provider, event_id) 唯一索引
  挡渠道重复投递（R21）。
end note

note bottom of LearningRecord
  挂人不挂报名（Q1）：记忆锚 = (course_id, user_id)；
  issue 三态（Todo/In Progress/Done）由记录派生，
  状态是投影不是手柄；退款重报记忆不清零（AE1）。
end note

note bottom of Enrollment
  两类关系互不替代（领域模型定稿 §2.1）：
  - Workspace 成员（长期运营角色） = WorkspaceMembership + MembershipRole
  - Event/Course 参与者（事件级） = Enrollment
  判断"谁能执行某个 Step"看成员角色；
  判断"谁报名了某活动"看 Enrollment。
end note

note bottom of WorkflowDefinition
  核心模型（workflow-first，D-A1/ADR-0002）：
  WorkflowDefinition（DAG 蓝图） + WorkflowRun（执行实例）
  一个定义可被多个 Event/Course 实例化复用（教研，D-A2）；
  改定义不影响已开始 run（运行中 run 持定义快照）。
end note

@enduml
